 "rules_text": {
  "O2": "Every RTH day: ON delta = sum(buy-sell) of 5m bars from 18:00 ET of the previous calendar day's file (Monday: Sunday file) to 09:30 ET (previous file missing: from 00:00 ET); needs ON volume >= 20,000 and ON delta != 0. d = sign(ON delta). Signal at the close of the 09:30 5m bar (>= 20 trades). Entry E5: limit at that close for 5 min (fills if the 09:35 bar trades 1 tick through), else market at the 09:40 open +18 ticks against. Stop 1 tick beyond the 09:30 bar's low (long) / high (short), at least 8 ticks from the fill; stop fill -2 ticks. One target at 2R (1 tick through). Time exit at the 10:25 bar close (10:30 ET) -2 ticks. $1.90 rt per micro.",
  "O1": "Same as O2, but trade only when the 09:30 5m bar closed in the same direction as the ON delta (d = the bar's direction; close == open: no trade)."
 },
